      "Language": "ger",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Besides the compensation of the damage German Law includes also to compensate the noneconomical damage as pain, cosmetic or psychic damage etc. The ophthalmological expert is to state his opinion in accordance with individual consequences of the damage for the given person. He is not obliged to make proposition about the amount of financial compensation of smart-money because this point has to deal with other juridical circumstances of the specific conditions of every individual case."},
